  {
    "id": 2023005030030,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～\r\nプロデューサー、かわいいでしょ～？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300503/2023005030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうだな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "雛菜とそのキャラクター、\r\nなんだか似てるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005030040,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "やは～♡\r\nほんと～？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300503/2023005030040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005030050,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "でも、そうだよね～\r\nどっちもかわいいもんね～？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300503/2023005030050"
  },
  {
