  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、制服もよく似合ってるし\r\nさっきの挨拶もよかった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "一日店員の準備、万端だな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005030060,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "うん～！\r\n接客の仕方とかも教えてもらったし",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040230020",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/202300503/2023005030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005030070,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "レポート記事に使う用の写真撮影も\r\nもう終わって～……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300503/2023005030070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005030080,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あとは一日店員さんやらせてもらって\r\nインタビューがあって、終わり！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300503/2023005030080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう、順調そうで何よりだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005030090,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "今日はプレオープンだから、\r\n短い時間しかやれなくて残念だけど～……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300503/2023005030090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005030100,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "雛菜はユアクマちゃんカフェの\r\n店員さんがやれて、すっごい楽しい～～～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300503/2023005030100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……\r\nやっぱりこの仕事を受けることにして、よかったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005030110,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "そうだね～？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300503/2023005030110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005030120,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "こうやって楽しいことがいっぱいあって～\r\n色んなことやらせてもらえて",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300503/2023005030120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005030130,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "そういう時、雛菜\r\n２８３プロに入ってよかったな～って思う！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300503/2023005030130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005030140,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "アイドルじゃなくても\r\nお店には遊びに来てたと思うし",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300503/2023005030140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005030150,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "アイドルじゃなくても\r\nカフェの店員さんとかにはなれたかもしれないけど",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300503/2023005030150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005030160,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "こんなにかわいくしてもらえて、\r\nそれで接客をするだけじゃなくって",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300503/2023005030160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005030170,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ユアクマちゃんがこんなにかわいいんだよ～って\r\n宣伝できるんだもん",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300503/2023005030170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005030180,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "雛菜がすきだな～って思うものを、\r\nすきだな～って言うのがお仕事で",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300503/2023005030180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005030190,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "それって、すっごいしあわせだよね～？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300503/2023005030190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな\r\nすごく恵まれてるし、幸せなことだと思うよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005030200,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ユアクマちゃんのコラボカフェは、\r\n今回が初めてなんだけどね",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300503/2023005030200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005030210,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "雛菜、ずっと\r\nやって欲しいな～って思ってたの！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300503/2023005030210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005030220,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "だって、他のキャラクターのカフェはあったのに、\r\nユアクマちゃんだけなかったんだよ～？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300503/2023005030220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお……\r\nさすが、詳しいな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005030230,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "それで、さっきお店の人に聞いたんだけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300503/2023005030230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005030240,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ちょっと癖のあるキャラクターだから\r\n最初はなかなかみんなに受け入れられなくて",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300503/2023005030240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005030250,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "色々試行錯誤して\r\n人気が出るまでに時間がかかったんだって～……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
